    {
      "id": 126701,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-19T19:20:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The game text of uh, yeah is treated as the text of all ongoing cards in the selected hero's play area. &nbsp;If the ongoing cards in that area change, the card is immediately updated. &nbsp;When Expect the worst leaves play nothing happens to Guise, since uh, yeah was copying that text, and scholar's card had no effect for Guise. &nbsp;It was scholar's card acting, not Guise's.</p><p>However, if guise was before scholar in turn order, at the start of Guide's turn the copied text would trigger, healing Guise and destroying uh, yeah I'm that guy. &nbsp;Because in this instance it is the copied text on Guise's card acting.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:01:11.685Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 11882,
      "topic_slug": "uh-yeah-im-that-guy-comes-into-play-abilities",
      "display_username": "phantaskippy",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
