      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>The game text of uh, yeah is treated as the text of all ongoing cards in the selected hero&#39;s play area. &nbsp;If the ongoing cards in that area change, the card is immediately updated. &nbsp;When Expect the worst leaves play nothing happens to Guise, since uh, yeah was copying that text, and scholar&#39;s card had no effect for Guise. &nbsp;It was scholar&#39;s card acting, not Guise&#39;s.</p><p>However, if guise was before scholar in turn order, at the start of Guide&#39;s turn the copied text would trigger, healing Guise and destroying uh, yeah I&#39;m that guy. &nbsp;Because in this instance it is the copied text on Guise&#39;s card acting.</p>",
